        "issue": "Strict wire equality rejects the fixed SDK non-strict tool-schema conversion.",
        "required": "Match the observed SDK wire form exactly while retaining strict host tool arguments; add a static-derived fixture."
      },
      {
        "id": "R2",
        "severity": "Important",
        "issue": "Workspace system instructions still forbid tools and omit logical source paths, output path and citation grammar.",
        "required": "Supply the complete bounded task contract and source manifest; preserve old zero-tool bytes."
      },
      {
        "id": "R3",
        "severity": "Important",
        "issue": "Invalid intermediate usage marks the task invalid without preventing further tools or requests.",
        "required": "Fail immediately and guard both tool and request entry; prove counters and reservations stop."
      },
      {
        "id": "R4",
        "severity": "Important",
        "issue": "Artifact recovery requires an in-process brand that cannot be reconstructed after publication crash.",
        "required": "Persist a minimal private task/output binding and strictly admit it read-only from a fresh process; do not replay or mutate."
      },
      {
        "id": "R5",
        "severity": "Important",
        "issue": "Missing or failed terminal records can admit plain-text failed task histories.",
        "required": "Bind each historical workspace task to a successful terminal record, even without tool history."
      },
      {
        "id": "R6",
        "severity": "Minor",
        "issue": "CLI success summary omits final response, request count, source summary and stop status.",
        "required": "Render the existing validated fields without exposing private history or credentials."
      }
    ],
